{"id":1661,"date":"2016-09-15T09:23:13","date_gmt":"2016-09-15T14:23:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=1661"},"modified":"2016-09-15T09:23:13","modified_gmt":"2016-09-15T14:23:13","slug":"look-kath-we-can-see-the-whole-thing","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/09\/15\/look-kath-we-can-see-the-whole-thing\/","title":{"rendered":"Look Kath, we can see the WHOLE thing!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Continuing our trek westward, we pulled in to Hidden Valley RV Park near Albuquerque, NM for the night. \u00a0It was pouring rain when we pulled in, the office was already closed (but they had our registration info in the box at the door). \u00a0We weren&#8217;t able to get a pull-thru site so we had to disconnect the car in the rain sto<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"  wp-image-1664 alignright\" src=\"\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-11-17-45-15.jpg\" alt=\"2016-09-11-17-45-15\" width=\"465\" height=\"261\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-11-17-45-15.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-11-17-45-15-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-11-17-45-15-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-11-17-45-15-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 465px) 100vw, 465px\" \/>rm out by the office, then drive on back to our spot (#53 all the way at the back) and then back in to our spot for the night. \u00a0Since we carry our food with us, \u00a0it was time for me to fir<br \/>\ne up the grill to cook some bratwurst for our dinner.<\/p>\n<p>As I was tending to the grill and Kathy was working in the kitchen, the skies began to clear and take a look at what we were blessed to see.<\/p>\n<p>[wpvideo BUA0wjL5]<\/p>\n<p>The park wasn&#8217;t anything to write home about, but the rainbow was a pleasant surprise.<\/p>\n<p>The next morning we headed on to Gallup, NM (<a href=\"http:\/\/www.usarvpark.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">USA RV Park<\/a>) where, although a nice clean park with nice level gravel sites, had few trees BUT we were lucky enough to get a spot right next to a shade tree. \u00a0Here again it rained after we pulled in so I wasn&#8217;t able to cook on the grill. \u00a0We went on to a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/ShowUserReviews-g47042-d1881649-r261043789-Virgie_s_Restaurant_and_Lounge-Gallup_New_Mexico.html\" target=\"_blank\">local Mexican restaurant<\/a> where we had a good meal and then visited the famous <a href=\"http:\/\/www.elranchohotel.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">EL RANCHO HOTEL<\/a> in Gallup where so many famous actors and others visited during the 30&#8217;s to 60&#8217;s. \u00a0I took a few pix of the building inside and out so you can see the impressive architecture.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-1661 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-12-15-14-12.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-12-15-14-12-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1688\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1688'>\n\t\t\t\tFront door of the El Rancho\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-12-15-15-53.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-12-15-15-53-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1687\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1687'>\n\t\t\t\tInside Front Lobby\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-12-15-16-11.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-12-15-16-11-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1686\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1686'>\n\t\t\t\tOne of the staircases in the lobby\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-12-15-18-56.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-12-15-18-56-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-1685\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-1685'>\n\t\t\t\tFrom the balcony looking down to the lobby\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>So in the morning we head off to our final destination of Camp Verde, AZ for our winter home. \u00a0More on that later.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Continuing our trek westward, we pulled in to Hidden Valley RV Park near Albuquerque, NM for the night. \u00a0It was pouring rain when we pulled in, the office was already closed (but they had our registration info in the box at the door). \u00a0We weren&#8217;t able to get a pull-thru site so we had to &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/09\/15\/look-kath-we-can-see-the-whole-thing\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Look Kath, we can see the WHOLE thing!<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403],"tags":[94629,2916155,993097,154049],"class_list":["post-1661","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","tag-albuquerque","tag-el-rancho","tag-gallup","tag-rainbow"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1661","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1661"}],"version-history":[{"count":25,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1661\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1693,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1661\/revisions\/1693"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1661"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1661"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1661"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}